OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer relives race to
OL,4,Asave trapped driver
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer who dragged an
OL,7,Funconscious woman from an overturned
OL,8,Fcar before helping revive her has
OL,9,Fspoken of the moment a doctor told her:
OL,10,F"If you hadn't cut her down, she would
OL,11,Fhave died."
OL,13,FPC Rebecca Edwards has been awarded a
OL,14,FRoyal Humane Society Resuscitation
OL,15,FCertificate after her actions at the
OL,16,Fcrash scene between Ombersley and
OL,17,FDroitwich in January.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
